{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 17, :comments ["<b>A man of your seed throughout their generations.</b> From here Rabbi Elazar ben Azaria said: a minor is unfit for the service, even though whole. And from when is his service valid? From when he brings two hairs, but his fellow priests do not let him serve until he is twenty years old." "<b>Whoever has in him a blemish.</b> After mentioning the holiness of the priests, he mentioned the blemishes that disqualify them."], :book :leviticus, :voice :chizkuni, :lang :en, :chapter 21, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-30T15:14:09.047269922Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}